      *                   PROGRAM COULD BE RECOMPILED FOR ORACLE 11G /
      *                   IBM 770 MIGRATION. Attempt 2
      * ----------------------------------------------------------------
      * 07/01/2010  BY: PENNY GENOVESE
      *           DESC: SINCE REPORTS ARE NO LONGER PRINTED, ONLY PRINT
      *                 HEADINGS ONCE.
      * ----------------------------------------------------------------
      * 03/31/08    BY: Janet Wilson
      *           DESC: MPTZ007-01 Transaction Error Report
      *                 Only create MPTZ007-01 report file when
      *                 Transaction Errors are found.
      *                 The COS Report distribution goes to Rpt.OEM.Fixit
      *                 so that when a MTPZ007-01 report is created,
      *                 it will be distributed.
      * ----------------------------------------------------------------
      * 06/16/04  BY: LITA MIRANDA
      *           DESC: ORACLE 9i MIGRATION
      *                 COMMENTED OUT WS-NAGS-TYPE IN WORKING STORAGE
      *                 (VARIABLE IS ALSO IN procedures_ws.cpy)
      * ----------------------------------------------------------------
      * 01/18/02  BY: GAIL WALDER
      *           DESC: 1. CORRECTED INITIALIZATION OF UPDATE BALANCE
      *                    FIELDS FOR INSERT INTO ACQ_UPDATE_BALANCE TABLE.
      *                    THE DATA WAS NOT BEING INSERTED.
      *                    NOTE: SQLCODE RETURNED FROM PROCEDURE CALL
      *                          WAS ZEROES (SUCCESSFUL CALL/INSERT)
      *                 2. DELETED VERIFIED-DATE, VERIFIED-USER AND
      *                    UPDATE-COMMENT FROM UPDATE BALANCE TABLE INSERT.
      *                    THESE COLUMNS ARE VALUED BY EDITORIAL STAFF.
      * ----------------------------------------------------------------
      * 03/15/01  BY: GAIL WALDER
      *           DESC: CORRECTED COMBINED CONTROL REPORT, MPTZ007-04,
      *                 SECTION B TOTALS ROUTINE
      * ----------------------------------------------------------------
      * 03/06/01  BY: GAIL WALDER
      *           DESC: RESTORED Y1000-SQL-ERROR PROCESSING FOR
      *                 EMBEDDED SQL
      * ----------------------------------------------------------------
      * 02/14/01  BY: MARINA BOGOPOLSKY
      *           DESC: ADDED Y1500-SQL-PROCEDURE-ERROR PARAGRAPH
      * ----------------------------------------------------------------
      * 05/17/00  BY:    JOHN NERIO
      *           DESC:  RACE II REVISIONS
      *                  1. CONVERTED FOR NEW DATABASE STRUCTURE
      *                  2. CONVERTED EMBEDDED SQL TO PKG/PROCEDURE CALLS
      * ----------------------------------------------------------------
      * 05/08/2000  BY :  KIM DINH
      *           DESC:  ADD LOGIC TO UPDATE THE UPDT_RUN_DT IN THE REFTBAL
      *                  TABLE WITH RUN DATE OF UPDATE JOB. ALSO ADD
      *                  CURR_EFF_DT TO ALL QUERIES THAT ACCESS IIST001 AND
      *                  IIST002 TABLES.
      * ----------------------------------------------------------------
      * 01/13/2000  BY:   KIM DINH
