      ***************************************************************
      * A0000-PROCESS-PARMS:                                        *
      *     1. VERIFY CONTROL PARMS PASSED IN EXECUTE OF PROGRAM    *
      *     2. ACCEPT SYSTEM DATE AND TIME                          *
      *     3. MOVE THIS INFORMATION TO HEADINGS                    *
      ***************************************************************
       A0000-PROCESS-PARMS.
           MOVE "A0000-PROCESS-PARMS" TO WS-PARAGRAPH.

           READ CONTROL-PARMS INTO WS-CNTL-PARM-REC
             AT END
               DISPLAY WS-ERR-MSG-CP1
               MOVE V-MISSING-CNTL-PARM TO WS-ABEND-CODE
               PERFORM Y2000-ABEND-RTN THRU Y2000-EXIT.

           MOVE CNTL-REGN-CD      TO WS-SEL-REGN-CD.
           MOVE CNTL-EFF-MONTH    TO WS-TEMP-EFF-MONTH.
           MOVE CNTL-EFF-DAY      TO WS-TEMP-EFF-DAY.
           MOVE CNTL-EFF-YEAR     TO WS-TEMP-EFF-YEAR.

           IF WS-TEMP-EFF-DT NOT NUMERIC OR WS-TEMP-EFF-DT <= ZEROES
             DISPLAY WS-ERR-MSG-CP3
             DISPLAY "WS-TEMP-EFF-DT: " WS-TEMP-EFF-DT
             MOVE V-INVALID-DATE TO WS-ABEND-CODE
             PERFORM Y2000-ABEND-RTN THRU Y2000-EXIT.

           MOVE CNTL-OEM-NUM      TO WS-SEL-OEM-NUM
                                     WS-PART-SUPPLIER-NUMBER.
           MOVE WS-SEL-REGN-CD    TO WS-REGN-LIT-NM
                                     WS-PART-SUPPLIER-COUNTRY-ABBR
                                     COUNTRY-EXCEPTIONS.
           MOVE WS-REGN-LIT       TO WS-REGN-LIT-X.

           PERFORM R1000-READ-OEM THRU R1000-EXIT.
           IF NOT-VALID-OEM
             DISPLAY WS-ERR-MSG-CP2
             DISPLAY "CNTL-OEM: " CNTL-OEM-NUM
             MOVE V-INVALID-CNTL-PARM TO WS-ABEND-CODE
             PERFORM Y2000-ABEND-RTN THRU Y2000-EXIT.

           ACCEPT WS-CURRENT-DT FROM DATE.
           MOVE WS-CD-MONTH  TO WS-FD-MONTH.
           MOVE WS-CD-DAY    TO WS-FD-DAY.
           MOVE WS-CD-YEAR   TO WS-FD-YEAR.
           MOVE WS-FORMAT-DT TO HDG-DT.

           ACCEPT WS-CURRENT-TM FROM TIME.
           MOVE WS-CT-HOUR   TO WS-FT-HOUR.
           MOVE WS-CT-MINUTE TO WS-FT-MINUTE.
           MOVE WS-CT-SECOND TO WS-FT-SECOND.
           MOVE WS-FORMAT-TM TO HDG-TM.

           MOVE CNTL-EFF-DT  TO HDG-EFF-DT.
           MOVE CNTL-EFF-DT  TO WS-CURRENT-EFFECTIVE-DATE.
           MOVE CNTL-OEM-NUM TO HDG-OEM-NUM.

           MOVE WS-PART-SUPPLIER-NAME-RGN TO HDG-OEM-NM.
           MOVE WS-PGMNAME TO HDG-PGMNAME, EOR-PGMNAME.

           IF CNTL-NAGS-TYP = "N/A     "
             NEXT SENTENCE
           ELSE
             MOVE CNTL-NAGS-TYP TO HDG-NAGS-TYP.

           MOVE CNTL-NAGS-TYP    TO  WS-NAGS-TYPE.
           MOVE CNTL-EFF-DT      TO  W-EFF-DT.
           MOVE CNTL-RUNTYP      TO  WS-RUN-TYPE.
           MOVE CNTL-REPLACE-IND TO  WS-REPLACEMENT-FLAG.

      *  BUILD THE RUN DATE WITH TIME STAMP

           MOVE WS-FD-MONTH      TO  WS-RFD-MONTH.
           MOVE WS-FD-DAY        TO  WS-RFD-DAY.
           MOVE WS-FD-YEAR       TO  WS-RFD-YEAR.
           MOVE WS-FT-HOUR       TO  WS-RFT-HOUR.
           MOVE WS-FT-SECOND     TO  WS-RFT-SECOND.
           MOVE WS-FT-MINUTE     TO  WS-RFT-MINUTE.
           MOVE WS-RUN-DT        TO  WS-RUN-DATE.

       A0000-EXIT. EXIT.


