      ***************************************************************
      * B2000-PRODUCE-REPORT02:                                     *
      *     PRODUCE MPTZ007-02A & B MULTIPLE SUPERSESSION REPORTS   *
      *     1. PERFORM INITIAL FETCH OF REPORT ROWS                 *
      *     2. IF ROWS NOT FOUND, PRODUCE EMPTY REPORT PAGE         *
      *        OTHERWISE, CONTINUE REPORT PROCESS.                  *
      *     3. WHEN ALL ROWS HAVE BEEN RETRIEVED AND REPORTED,      *
