      ***************************************************************
      * B4000-PRODUCE-REPORT04:                                     *
      *     PRODUCE TWO MPTZ007-04 OEM UPDATE COMBINED CONTROL RPTS *
      *     A- FOR INFORMATION SYSTEMS ONLY                         *
      *        CONTAINS TRANS AND DATABASE ACTIVITY INFORMATION     *
      *     B- FOR EDITORIAL CLIENTS AND INFORMATION SYSTEMS        *
      *        CONTAINS UPDATE ACTIVITY INFORMATION                 *
      *                                                             *
      *     1. WRITE HEADINGS FOR REPORTS "A" AND "B"               *
      *     2. TO PRODUCE SECTION 1 (TRANSACTION INFO):             *
      *        EACH SPECIFIC LINE IS SELECTED FROM THE Oracle TABLE *
      *        AND PRINTED. THE LINE INFORMATION IS ALSO TOTALED    *
      *        AND AFTER THE "PRICING" LINE IS PRINTED, A TOTAL     *
      *        LINE IS FORMATTED AND WRITTEN.                       *
      *     3. IF NO TRANS CONTROL REPORT ROWS WERE FOUND, FORCE AN *
      *        ABEND.                                               *
      *     4. TO PRODUCE SECTION 2 (DATABASE ACTIVITY):            *
      *        EACH PRINTED REPORT LINE IS CREATED BY FETCHING ALL  *
      *        THE RELATED UPDATE LINES (E.G. "A" PARTS DB TOTALS,  *
      *        "C" PARTS DB TOTALS, "N" PARTS DB TOTALS, "D" PARTS  *
      *        DB TOTALS AND "P" PARTS DB TOTALS), TOTALLING THEM   *
      *        IN WORKING STORAGE, AND THEN WRITING THE TOTALS IN   *
      *        ONE LINE.                                            *
      *        THE COLUMNS IN THE PRINTED LINES ARE TOTALLED AS WELL*
      *        AND AFTER THE "TRANS REPORTS" LINE IS PRINTED, A     *
      *        TOTAL LINE IS FORMATTED AND WRITTEN.                 *
      *     5. TO PRODUCE THE UPDATE ACTIVITY INFORMATION:          *
      *        EACH SPECIFIC LINE IS SELECTED FROM THE Oracle TABLE *
      *        AND PRINTED.                                         *
      *                                                             *
      ***************************************************************
       B4000-PRODUCE-REPORT04.
           MOVE "B4000-PRODUCE-REPORT04" TO WS-PARAGRAPH.

           MOVE "MPTZ007-04"   TO WS-REPORT-NUMBER.

           PERFORM H4000-REPORT04-HDG-RTN THRU H4000-EXIT.

           INITIALIZE ACQ-UPDATE-BALANCE
             REPLACING ALPHANUMERIC BY SPACES
                       NUMERIC BY ZEROES.

      * REPORT A - TRANSACTION INFO

           WRITE RPT04A-LINE FROM SUBHEAD-04-1A AFTER 5 LINES.
           WRITE RPT04A-LINE FROM SUBHEAD-04-1B AFTER 1 LINE.
           WRITE RPT04A-LINE FROM SUBHEAD-04-2  AFTER 1 LINE.

      * REPORT A - REVERSE SUPERSESSION TRANS INFO
           MOVE SPACES              TO WS-SEL-SORT-DATA.
           MOVE "RA1"               TO WS-SEL-SORT-DATA.
           PERFORM R9100-READ-RPT04-ACTVY-ROW THRU R9100-EXIT.
           PERFORM G4000-REPORT04-DTLA-RTN    THRU G4000-EXIT.
           MOVE WS-TRANS-READ-AMT   TO   REVERSE-SUPER-READ-CNT.
           MOVE WS-PROC-AMT         TO   REVERSE-SUPER-PROC-CNT.
           MOVE WS-NOT-PROC-AMT     TO   REVERSE-SUPER-BYPASSED-CNT.

      * REPORT A - ASSEMBLY-TO-COMPONENT TRANS INFO
           MOVE "AA1"               TO WS-SEL-SORT-DATA.
           PERFORM R9100-READ-RPT04-ACTVY-ROW THRU R9100-EXIT.
           PERFORM G4000-REPORT04-DTLA-RTN    THRU G4000-EXIT.
           MOVE WS-TRANS-READ-AMT   TO ASSY-TO-COMPNT-READ-CNT.
           MOVE WS-PROC-AMT         TO ASSY-TO-COMPNT-PROC-CNT.
           MOVE WS-NOT-PROC-AMT     TO ASSY-TO-COMPNT-BYPASSED-CNT.

      * REPORT A - COMPONENT-TO-ASSEMBLY TRANS INFO
           MOVE "CA1"               TO WS-SEL-SORT-DATA.
           PERFORM R9100-READ-RPT04-ACTVY-ROW THRU R9100-EXIT.
           PERFORM G4000-REPORT04-DTLA-RTN    THRU G4000-EXIT.
           MOVE WS-TRANS-READ-AMT   TO COMPNT-TO-ASSY-READ-CNT.
           MOVE WS-PROC-AMT         TO COMPNT-TO-ASSY-PROC-CNT.
           MOVE WS-NOT-PROC-AMT     TO COMPNT-TO-ASSY-BYPASSED-CNT.

      * REPORT A - SUPERSESSION TRANS INFO
           MOVE "NA1"               TO WS-SEL-SORT-DATA.
           PERFORM R9100-READ-RPT04-ACTVY-ROW THRU R9100-EXIT.
           PERFORM G4000-REPORT04-DTLA-RTN    THRU G4000-EXIT.
           MOVE WS-TRANS-READ-AMT   TO SUPER-READ-CNT.
           MOVE WS-PROC-AMT         TO SUPER-PROC-CNT.
           MOVE WS-NOT-PROC-AMT     TO SUPER-BYPASSED-CNT.

      * REPORT A - DISCONTINUE TRANS INFO
           MOVE "DA1"               TO WS-SEL-SORT-DATA.
           PERFORM R9100-READ-RPT04-ACTVY-ROW THRU R9100-EXIT.
           PERFORM G4000-REPORT04-DTLA-RTN    THRU G4000-EXIT.
           MOVE WS-TRANS-READ-AMT   TO DISC-READ-CNT.
           MOVE WS-PROC-AMT         TO DISC-PROC-CNT.
           MOVE WS-NOT-PROC-AMT     TO DISC-BYPASSED-CNT.

      * REPORT A - PRICING TRANS INFO
           MOVE "PA1"               TO WS-SEL-SORT-DATA.
           PERFORM R9100-READ-RPT04-ACTVY-ROW THRU R9100-EXIT.
           PERFORM G4000-REPORT04-DTLA-RTN    THRU G4000-EXIT.
           MOVE WS-TRANS-READ-AMT   TO PRICE-READ-CNT.
           MOVE WS-PROC-AMT         TO PRICE-PROC-CNT.
           MOVE WS-NOT-PROC-AMT     TO PRICE-BYPASSED-CNT.

           IF CONTROL-ROWS-NOT-FOUND
             PERFORM G9998-EMPTY-RPT-RTN THRU G9998-EXIT
             DISPLAY WS-ERR-MSG-CP8
             DISPLAY "WS-REPORT-SW: " WS-REPORT-SW
             MOVE V-INVALID-CNTL-PARM TO WS-ABEND-CODE
             PERFORM Y2000-ABEND-RTN THRU Y2000-EXIT.

           PERFORM G4050-REPORT04-TOTLNA-RTN THRU G4050-EXIT.

      * REPORT A - SECTION B - DATABASE INFO

           WRITE RPT04A-LINE FROM SUBHEAD-04-3 AFTER 5 LINES.
           WRITE RPT04A-LINE FROM SUBHEAD-04-4 AFTER 1 LINE.
           WRITE RPT04A-LINE FROM SUBHEAD-04-5 AFTER 1 LINE.

      * REPORT A - PARTS DATABASE INFO
           MOVE SPACES       TO WS-SEL-SORT-DATA.
           MOVE "%B1"        TO WS-SEL-SORT-DATA.
           PERFORM R9150-READ-RPT04-DB-ACTVY-ROWS THRU R9150-EXIT.
           PERFORM G4100-REPORT04-DTLB-RTN        THRU G4100-EXIT.

      * REPORT A - SUPERSESSION DATABASE INFO
           MOVE "%B2"        TO WS-SEL-SORT-DATA.
           PERFORM R9150-READ-RPT04-DB-ACTVY-ROWS THRU R9150-EXIT.
           PERFORM G4100-REPORT04-DTLB-RTN        THRU G4100-EXIT.

      * REPORT A - CEG LINES DATABASE INFO
           MOVE "%B3"        TO WS-SEL-SORT-DATA.
           PERFORM R9150-READ-RPT04-DB-ACTVY-ROWS THRU R9150-EXIT.
           PERFORM G4100-REPORT04-DTLB-RTN        THRU G4100-EXIT.
      * REPORT A - WIP LINES DATABASE INFO
           MOVE "%B4"        TO WS-SEL-SORT-DATA.
           PERFORM R9150-READ-RPT04-DB-ACTVY-ROWS THRU R9150-EXIT.
           PERFORM G4100-REPORT04-DTLB-RTN        THRU G4100-EXIT.

      * REPORT A - ALTPARTS DATABASE INFO
           MOVE "%B6"        TO WS-SEL-SORT-DATA.
           PERFORM R9150-READ-RPT04-DB-ACTVY-ROWS THRU R9150-EXIT.
           PERFORM G4100-REPORT04-DTLB-RTN        THRU G4100-EXIT.

      * REPORT A - TRANS REPORTS INFO
           MOVE "%B7"        TO WS-SEL-SORT-DATA.
           PERFORM R9150-READ-RPT04-DB-ACTVY-ROWS THRU R9150-EXIT.
           PERFORM G4100-REPORT04-DTLB-RTN        THRU G4100-EXIT.

      * REPORT A - ERROR REPORTS INFO
           MOVE "%B8"        TO WS-SEL-SORT-DATA.
           PERFORM R9150-READ-RPT04-DB-ACTVY-ROWS THRU R9150-EXIT.
           PERFORM G4100-REPORT04-DTLB-RTN        THRU G4100-EXIT.

           PERFORM G4150-REPORT04-TOTLNB-RTN THRU G4150-EXIT.

      * REPORT B - UPDATE ACTIVITY INFO

           WRITE RPT04B-LINE FROM SUBHEAD-04-6 AFTER 3 LINES.
           WRITE RPT04B-LINE FROM SUBHEAD-04-7 AFTER 1 LINE.
           WRITE RPT04B-LINE FROM SUBHEAD-04-8 AFTER 1 LINE.

           MOVE SUPER-UPDT-TYPE TO RPT04-UPDT-TYPE.
           WRITE RPT04B-LINE FROM SUBHEAD-04-9 AFTER 1 LINE.

      * REPORT B - ASSEMBLY-TO-COMPONENT UPDATE ACTIVITY
           MOVE SPACES                TO WS-SEL-SORT-DATA.
           MOVE "SC1"                 TO WS-SEL-SORT-DATA.
           PERFORM R9100-READ-RPT04-ACTVY-ROW THRU R9100-EXIT.
           PERFORM G4200-REPORT04-DTLC-RTN    THRU G4200-EXIT.
           MOVE  WS-RPT04-CEG-PRT-CTR TO PR-ASSY-TO-COMPNT-PART-CNT.
           MOVE  WS-RPT04-CEG-LN-CTR  TO PR-ASSY-TO-COMPNT-QX-CNT.
           MOVE  WS-RPT04-WIP-PRT-CTR TO WP-ASSY-TO-COMPNT-PART-CNT.
           MOVE  WS-RPT04-WIP-LN-CTR  TO WP-ASSY-TO-COMPNT-QX-CNT.
           MOVE  WS-RPT04-PRT-DB-CTR  TO ASSY-TO-COMPNT-PART-CNT.

      * REPORT B - COMPONENT-TO-ASSEMBLY UPDATE ACTIVITY
           MOVE "SC2"                 TO WS-SEL-SORT-DATA.
           PERFORM R9100-READ-RPT04-ACTVY-ROW THRU R9100-EXIT.
           PERFORM G4200-REPORT04-DTLC-RTN    THRU G4200-EXIT.
           MOVE  WS-RPT04-CEG-PRT-CTR TO PR-COMPNT-TO-ASSY-PART-CNT.
           MOVE  WS-RPT04-CEG-LN-CTR  TO PR-COMPNT-TO-ASSY-QX-CNT.
           MOVE  WS-RPT04-WIP-PRT-CTR TO WP-COMPNT-TO-ASSY-PART-CNT.
           MOVE  WS-RPT04-WIP-LN-CTR  TO WP-COMPNT-TO-ASSY-QX-CNT.
           MOVE  WS-RPT04-PRT-DB-CTR  TO COMPNT-TO-ASSY-PART-CNT.

      * REPORT B - SUPERSEDED NEWLY UPDATE ACTIVITY
           MOVE "SC3"                 TO WS-SEL-SORT-DATA.
           PERFORM R9100-READ-RPT04-ACTVY-ROW THRU R9100-EXIT.
           PERFORM G4200-REPORT04-DTLC-RTN    THRU G4200-EXIT.
           MOVE  WS-RPT04-CEG-PRT-CTR TO PR-NEW-SUPER-PART-CNT.
           MOVE  WS-RPT04-CEG-LN-CTR  TO PR-NEW-SUPER-QX-CNT.
