               MOVE SPACES                  TO RPT02-NEW-PART-NUM
               MOVE SPACES                  TO RPT02-NEW-PART-DESC
               IF RPT02-OLD-PART-NUM EQUAL WS-PREV-OLD-PART-NUM
                 MOVE SPACES                TO RPT02-OLD-PART-NUM
