      ***************************************************************
       G4200-REPORT04-DTLC-RTN.
           MOVE "G4200-REPORT04-DTLC-RTN" TO WS-PARAGRAPH.

           MOVE ZEROES      TO    WS-RPT04-CEG-PRT-CTR,
                                  WS-RPT04-CEG-LN-CTR,
