           IF RPT-ROW-FOUND
             MOVE REPORT-DATA       TO DETAIL-04C
             WRITE RPT04B-LINE FROM DETAIL-04C AFTER 1 LINE
             MOVE RPT04-CEG-PRT-CTR TO  WS-RPT04-CEG-PRT-CTR
             MOVE RPT04-CEG-LN-CTR  TO  WS-RPT04-CEG-LN-CTR
             MOVE RPT04-WIP-PRT-CTR TO  WS-RPT04-WIP-PRT-CTR
             MOVE RPT04-WIP-LN-CTR  TO  WS-RPT04-WIP-LN-CTR
             MOVE RPT04-PRT-DB-CTR  TO  WS-RPT04-PRT-DB-CTR
             GO TO G4200-EXIT.

