                     MOVE PRICE-ACTVY-4 TO RPT04-UPDT-ACTVY
                   ELSE
                     IF SRT4-REC-TYPE-CTR = 5
                       MOVE PRICE-ACTVY-5 TO RPT04-UPDT-ACTVY
                     ELSE
                       IF SRT4-REC-TYPE-CTR = 6
                         MOVE PRICE-ACTVY-6 TO RPT04-UPDT-ACTVY
                       ELSE
                         IF SRT4-REC-TYPE-CTR = 7
                           MOVE PRICE-ACTVY-7 TO RPT04-UPDT-ACTVY
                         ELSE
